[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 17461.27, "timestamp": "04:51:01", "text": "このホロライブってやつが何なのか調べてみた"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17464.23, "timestamp": "04:51:04", "text": "そして全て。私はKissに出会った"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17467.708, "timestamp": "04:51:07", "text": "目が最初に来て、私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17470.708, "timestamp": "04:51:10", "text": "ビデオを見て、モデルが"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17473.43, "timestamp": "04:51:13", "text": "3Dモデルは動くことができ、表現力はどの程度か"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17475.83, "timestamp": "04:51:15", "text": "そして全て。私は「うわあ、これは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17478.23, "timestamp": "04:51:18", "text": "すごくかっこいい。まるで"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17481.43, "timestamp": "04:51:21", "text": "顔を超えて、顔を見せて"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17483.99, "timestamp": "04:51:23", "text": "もの。これは実際に私に役立つかもしれない"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17487.67, "timestamp": "04:51:27", "text": "私の野望は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17490.15, "timestamp": "04:51:30", "text": "あの時。だから私は「うん、できるよ」って思った"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17492.788, "timestamp": "04:51:32", "text": "これについて調べてください。それで私は見始めた"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17495.03, "timestamp": "04:51:35", "text": "毎日目にキスをする"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 17496.041, "timestamp": "04:51:36", "author": "@Minkk102", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/TF8h5uIigJBanBg4LA_XZaY69S8H6wHtAUIDSGgMxHUqkEYRKq0z9m5NM8cqeDFnXLN0nN8i8g=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "no way me also got introducted to vtubing bcuz of miku "}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17498.788, "timestamp": "04:51:38", "text": "ストリーミング配信されました。そして彼らは動画をアップロードした。それから"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17501.75, "timestamp": "04:51:41", "text": "それから３つ、３つ、えっと、何を"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17505.19, "timestamp": "04:51:45", "text": "それって何？ YouTuberの三巨頭。キス"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17508.31, "timestamp": "04:51:48", "text": "目に。えっと、彼女の名前は何でしたっけ？おお"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17510.868, "timestamp": "04:51:50", "text": "我が神よ。彼女は私のお気に入りの一人です。"}